<title>USA: Delta in maintenance deal with ABX Air.</title>
<headline>Delta in maintenance deal with ABX Air.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said on Wednesday that it signed a memorandum of understanding with Airborne Express Inc's ABX Air Inc unit to provide maintenance and technical service for Airborne's Boeing 767-200 fleet.</p>
<p>Delta said in a news release that the 10-year agreement is to begin in 1998, with Delta providing engine, auxiliary power unit, component and airframe services for ABX's 767-200 fleet, expected to number 12 aircraft by the year 2000.</p>
</text>
